title: "Non-compensatory Biological Dynamics"
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/krilito/noncompensatory-biological-dynamics"
abstract: >-
  Code, source data and reproducibility materials for paired longitudinal
  transcriptomic analysis in melanoma immune checkpoint blockade. Paired
  pretreatment and on-treatment measurements are mapped into a frozen T/E/X/C
  representation and evaluated through separable observation interfaces.
